Error [jet.UnknownName]: `_` is not a name, so it has no value to read
  --> Tests/UI/Ownership/discard_binding_is_not_a_referenceable_local.jet:5:13
    |
  5 |     consume(_)
    |             ^
 Why: `_` throws a value away where a binding would go; it never names one
 Fix: To throw a value away write `_: value`; to read it, bind it to a name and read that name
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107
